  "_about": "Non-Claude readers for the ablation ladder, and the fallback chain for single requests. Read by scripts/voices.mjs. Keys live OUTSIDE the repo at maddy-home/key-<provider>.txt (or <PROVIDER>_API_KEY) and are only ever sent as a request header. Free tiers only unless the user says otherwise (2026-09-23). A voice's `family` is its pretraining lineage: the point of a panel is several families, so two voices of one family add samples, not independence. `thinking` applies in both ablation modes; `temperature` defaults to 1.0 and is sent explicitly.",
